1
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:34,200
Silently read again.

2
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:41,460
The New School

3
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:51,260
My new school is built on old school site.

4
00:00:53,160 --> 00:01:03,130
Looking from afar, yellow walls, red tiles shine among trees.

5
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:12,060
I step into classroom, both surprised and familiar.

6
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:23,460
White lime walls, blue doors, rosewood desks and chairs...

7
00:01:25,430 --> 00:01:31,760
All shine and smell fragrant in autumn sunlight.

